  "id": "Wandsworth-2026_0624",
  "appeal_status": null,
  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "description": "Conversion from single dwellinghouse to 4-bedroom and 2-bedroom flats.",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development, by reason of layout and design would fail to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupiers as the kitchen/dining room and bedroom 1 within Flat 1 would have poor levels of outlook, daylight/sunlight and ventilation. The substandard accommodation is further contributed to by the absence of outdoor private amenity space. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy LP27 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023), policy D6 of the London Plan (2024) and the NPPF (2024).",
    "Reason : 2 - The submitted FRA does not comply with the requirements set out in the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF). The FRA and associated documents do not therefore provide a suitable basis for assessment to be made of the flood risks arising from the proposed development. The proposals therefore fail to comply with Policy LP12 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023) and the NPPF (2024). ",
    "Reason : 3 - In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to make available detailed advice in the form of our statutory policies in the Local Plan as well as offering a full pre application advice service. However, we have been unable to seek solutions to problems as the proposal is clearly contrary to our statutory policies and negotiation could not overcome the reasons for refusal."
  ],
